        "Abstract": "Large language models are commonly trained on a mixture of filtered web data and curated 'high-quality' corpora. We show that properly filtered and deduplicated web data alone can lead to powerful models, outperforming models trained on The Pile. We release a 600B tokens extract of our RefinedWeb dataset and 1.3/7.5B parameters language models trained on it."
